OL,7,GOutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FAfter
OL,8,Fa dry Thursday, Friday and Saturday    
OL,9,Fbring outbreaks of rain, heavy and     
OL,10,Fpersistent at times, turning to snow   
OL,11,Fover northern hills with strong        
OL,12,Fcoastal winds. Chilly nights bring     
OL,13,Ffrost.                                 
